Print Substrings with Length Greater Than 2

Given a string S, print all substrings whose length is greater than 2.

If the string is empty, print:

String is Empty
If no substring has length greater than 2, print:

No substring length > 2
Finally, print the count of valid substrings.

Input Format

A single string S

Constraints

0 <= S.length() <= 100
Output Format

Print all substrings having length greater than 2.
Print:
`text Count = value

Sample Input 0

text
Sample Output 0

tex
text
ext
Count = 3
Sample Input 1

text
apple
Sample Output 1

tex
text
ext
Count = 3
